<title>USA: Liqui-Box to buy back up to $6 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Liqui-Box to buy back up to $6 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WORTHINGTON, Ohio 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liqui-Box Corp said Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to $6.0 million of the company's common shares over the next year.</p>
<p>The shares may be bought in the open market or in private transactions, it said.</p>
<p>It said it plans to hold the shares repurchased in its treasury.</p>
<p>Liqui-Box makes bulk liquid packaging systems.</p>
